  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resilient Recovery Rapid Readiness Support in the Kingdom of Morocco</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The scope of the Readiness project will work in close synergy with &quot;MA10 Organic Waste to Energy Program (OWtE) in Morocco&quot; issued by the KliK Foundation of the Swiss Government, which refers to carbon credit transfers within Article 6 of the Paris Agreement. MA10 is implemented by GGGI as part of a Consortium with &quot;First Climate (Switzerland) and MSConex (Morocco).</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This GCF Readiness project will directly support a key component of the first phase of the Organic Waste to Energy Program in Morocco (OWtE), which is being developed in response to an official request for technical assistance from the Ministry of Energy, Mining and Environment, Department of Energy to GGGI, the Delivery Partner for this GCF Readiness project.</narrative>
  </description>
